%!PS
% Source of two-pages.pdf (see make.sh): two A4 pages with a line of text each.
[ /Title (Fixture document) /DOCINFO pdfmark
<< /PageSize [595 842] >> setpagedevice
/Helvetica findfont 24 scalefont setfont
72 760 moveto (Page one says alpha) show
0 0 1 setrgbcolor 72 400 moveto 523 400 lineto 8 setlinewidth stroke
showpage
/Helvetica findfont 24 scalefont setfont
72 760 moveto (Page two says beta) show
1 0 0 setrgbcolor 72 400 moveto 523 400 lineto 8 setlinewidth stroke
showpage
